{{shell}}```bash
{{run}}pytest                 # the tests: keep them green
{{run}}operonx lint           # the rules below, checked (operonx lint --rules)
{{run}}operonx serve --list   # every service, and where it listens
{{run}}operonx run --list     # every job
{{run}}operonx serve          # serve every service (and run scheduled jobs on their clocks)
